OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStorm Austen
OL,6,Fclearing with winds easing this
OL,7,Fevening. Showers continuing across
OL,8,Fsome southwestern areas but most
OL,9,Fplaces becoming dry with clear spells.
OL,10,FCold and locally frosty in the
OL,11,Fnortheast but rain and freshening
OL,12,Fwinds arriving in the far west later.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAfter a bright start in some
OL,15,Feastern areas, heavy rain and
OL,16,Fstrengthening winds quickly sweeping
OL,17,Feast as Storm Boelo arrives. Gales
OL,18,Fdeveloping for many with damaging
OL,19,Fwinds possible further north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
